title: ninja_duelist
---
Duelist: Quiet. The Leader is meditating. Slam the door and I have to kill you. ...Good. You managed it. What do you want?
-> Heard you're working with pirates now.
    <<jump ninja_duelist__1>>
-> Any tips for the bird?
    <<jump ninja_duelist__2>>
-> Carry on.
===

title: ninja_duelist__1
---
Duelist: Temporary. Bird first, pirates later. I can smell the cove from here.
-> Ask another question.
    <<jump ninja_duelist>>
-> Carry on.
===

title: ninja_duelist__2
---
Duelist: It steals voices. Wait for the gap after it calls, then go. If it starts sounding like you, stop listening.
-> Ask another question.
    <<jump ninja_duelist>>
-> Carry on.
===

title: ninja_leader
---
Shadow Oni: You came in without invitation. I have not decided whether that was nerve or skill. The Mockingbird stole one of our katas. It dies for that. The pirates happen to want the same bird.
-> Why team up with the pirates?
    <<jump ninja_leader__1>>
-> What's your grievance with the bird?
    <<jump ninja_leader__2>>
-> Where does the dojo stand on the cove?
    <<jump ninja_leader__3>>
-> Open the arena door.
===

title: ninja_leader__1
---
Shadow Oni: The Admiral keeps the east side. We take the roofs. Nobody sings at anyone, nobody touches anyone else's weapons, and this arrangement ends with the bird.
-> Ask another question.
    <<jump ninja_leader>>
-> Open the arena door.
===

title: ninja_leader__2
---
Shadow Oni: It watched one morning lesson. At dawn it came back, did the kata in our courtyard, then laughed in my voice. I want its beak.
-> Ask another question.
    <<jump ninja_leader>>
-> Open the arena door.
===

title: ninja_leader__3
---
Shadow Oni: Tell the Admiral we hold the eastern thermals. Afterward he goes back to his cove. I go back to wishing he had stayed there.
-> Ask another question.
    <<jump ninja_leader>>
-> Open the arena door.
===
